--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
no body for callee
--
N5008 [alg.sort]/1: libc++ 18 declares std::__sort<__less<T> &, T *> for
the arithmetic types `extern template' and defines the template only in
libc++.so (src/algorithm.cpp), so these calls had no body (bin53).
provide_stdlib_bodies models it as an insertion sort with `<'.  clang++
18 -stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG
assertion.
